y","statement":"POST /process/text declares process_text as the entry handler.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":7,"endLine":12}]},{"id":"principal-verified-user","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler obtains its caller from get_verified_user.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":8,"endLine":12}]},{"id":"resource-selected-collection","kind":"binding","statement":"The target collection is taken from form_data.collection_name when supplied by the caller.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":13,"endLine":17}]},{"id":"write-access-control","kind":"control","statement":"A supplied collection is checked through _validate_collection_access with access_type='write', and that validator delegates to filter_accessible_collections and rejects any denied name with HTTP 403.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":16,"endLine":17},{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":31,"endLine":44}]},{"id":"kb-write-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"For a non-admin knowledge-base name, the shared policy admits the collection only when Knowledges.check_access_by_user_id succeeds for the requested access type; a missing knowledge base is the only case allowed by the fallback.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-bc2fc3bd01b481d9","startLine":22,"endLine":24},{"sourceId":"src-bc2fc3bd01b481d9","startLine":43,"endLine":51}]},{"id":"text-write-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After authorization, the caller-selected text is placed in a Document and passed with the collection name to save_docs_to_vector_db.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":19,"endLine":28}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":2929,"output":849,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":47001.0341,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T13:09:43.967Z"}}
